Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.25,0:00:04.27,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,Did you call for me, Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.01,0:00:08.15,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,I'm thinking about sending Kunon \Nto the school for noble children.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.51,0:00:11.03,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,But Kunon hasn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.35,0:00:16.03,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Right. He's never been outside of the mansion \Nexcept for a handful of times since birth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.66,0:00:21.79,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,He'll be scared of strangers \Nin the outside world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.65,0:00:25.42,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,That's why I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.17,0:00:34.05,main - flashback,IXIO,0,0,0,,Wanna play outside for a change?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.05,0:00:36.05,main - flashback,KUNON,0,0,0,,But I can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.05,0:00:37.55,main - flashback,IXIO,0,0,0,,You'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.55,0:00:38.93,main - flashback,IXIO,0,0,0,,I'll hold your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.31,0:00:56.77,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,Understood, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.26,0:00:59.70,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,I'll protect Kunon at any cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.01,0:01:02.99,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,As his big brother, no matter \Nwhat happens this time around!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.93,0:01:18.72,main,IKO,0,0,0,,What are you reading about?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.42,0:01:21.24,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Hydromancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.56,0:01:24.89,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,You fill a container processed with \Nsupernatural powers with water
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.89,0:01:27.73,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,and tell fortunes or look for missing items.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.98,0:01:32.36,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Can we look for my first flush of \Nyouth and its brilliance that I've lost?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.36,0:01:36.24,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Don't worry. You're young and right \Nin the middle of the bloom of youth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.59,0:01:40.57,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Can we use that whatchamacallit-mancy \Nto find my groom-to-be?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.83,0:01:44.26,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,You're a fine woman, \Nand men will be all over you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.26,0:01:47.92,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,If I weren't the second son of the marquess, \NI'd take you as my bride.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.92,0:01:52.33,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Oh please, what are you saying to a woman \Nmore than ten years older than you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.15,0:01:56.79,main,FLORA,0,0,0,,How are you so cheerful?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.16,0:03:34.17,main - top,SIGN,0,0,0,,TO THE SCHOOL FOR NOBLE CHILDREN
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.81,0:03:32.65,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Therefore, when creating a\Nsettlement and populating it,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.65,0:03:37.00,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,the top priority must be securing water.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.34,0:03:39.32,main,FLORA,0,0,0,,An excellent answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.17,0:03:44.87,main - italics,FLORA/I,0,0,0,,I've given him lectures and taught \Nhim manners as a noble gentleman.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.56,0:03:48.99,main - flashback,IKO,0,0,0,,And why not make him a gentleman \Nwith a sense of humor?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.78,0:03:51.88,main - italics,FLORA/I,0,0,0,,But was I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.87,0:03:57.88,main - italics,FLORA/I,0,0,0,,A jolly man can be attractive, \Nand that suits Master Kunon better.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.23,0:04:00.93,main - italics,FLORA/I,0,0,0,,He may be seen as a bit shallow, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.29,0:04:03.03,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,What's making you look concerned?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.03,0:04:06.02,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Here's to looking at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.34,0:04:08.51,main - italics,FLORA/I,0,0,0,,Okay, {\i0}quite{\i1} shallow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.22,0:04:13.77,main - italics,FLORA/I,0,0,0,,But compared to when I met him, \Nhe's become a lot more adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.15,0:04:21.21,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,This is a twelve-year vintage from the New \NKingdom, worthy of beautiful Lady Flora.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.21,0:04:22.65,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Enchanting aroma, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.65,0:04:25.25,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Oh, no, it's not, Master Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.25,0:04:27.91,main,IKO,0,0,0,,This is from Hughlia. Domestic tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.91,0:04:29.43,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Never mind, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.04,0:04:39.62,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Shall we get going?\N Lord Gurion is waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.62,0:04:40.55,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.46,0:04:45.55,main,IKO,0,0,0,,It's cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.09,0:04:48.32,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Master Kunon, \Ncan you make you-know-what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.32,0:04:49.81,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Sure, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.03,0:04:53.06,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,A-ori.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.83,0:04:59.97,main,IKO,0,0,0,,So warm! So squishy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.97,0:05:03.06,main,IKO,0,0,0,,This feels so nice to the touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.06,0:05:07.64,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I encased water with a super soft \Nand stretchy membrane.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.64,0:05:09.61,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,It's still a prototype, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.61,0:05:11.67,main,IKO,0,0,0,,I want a bed of this to sleep in!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.67,0:05:13.39,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm thinking about that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.75,0:05:18.43,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,By the way, I wonder what Father \Nwould like to speak to me about.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.43,0:05:19.85,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Did I do something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.22,0:05:23.89,main,IKO,0,0,0,,I don't think you've done \Nanything to get yelled at.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.89,0:05:26.63,main,IKO,0,0,0,,You learned your lesson from \Nthe sea of blood incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.19,0:05:33.39,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,That was because you said, \N"Then let's go all out."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.63,0:05:35.76,main,IKO,0,0,0,,That was a bit too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.76,0:05:38.43,main,IKO,0,0,0,,But I don't hate stuff like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.43,0:05:39.65,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.43,0:05:45.65,main,BALEN,0,0,0,,Master Kunon, we've been expecting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.01,0:05:47.48,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Good evening, Balen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.48,0:05:49.82,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,Hey, it's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.61,0:05:53.73,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Big Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.46,0:06:02.43,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,Want me to lead you by the hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.43,0:06:03.89,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.89,0:06:07.17,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I can sense what's around \Nme pretty well now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.63,0:06:09.93,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,That's also your magic, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.93,0:06:20.93,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Big Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.71,0:06:24.78,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,It's nothing. I'm glad you're doing great.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.70,0:06:30.19,main,BALEN,0,0,0,,My lord, my lady, they are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.32,0:06:34.91,main,TINALISA,0,0,0,,Welcome, Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.14,0:06:37.82,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Good evening, Mother, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.11,0:06:43.92,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,There's something important to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.02,0:06:49.45,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Lady Flora told us you finished what they \Ncover at the school for noble children.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.45,0:06:53.18,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,But aren't you interested in \Ngoing to the actual school?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.40,0:06:54.70,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I am not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.70,0:06:57.11,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'd hate to trouble those around me,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.58,0:07:01.69,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,and I have something I want \Nto prioritize over school.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.02,0:07:06.69,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,I've always believed you should \Ndo what your heart desires.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.17,0:07:09.82,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Is there a problem if I don't go to school?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.28,0:07:14.24,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Noble children are obligated to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.24,0:07:18.26,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,On paper, you are enrolled in \Nthe school for noble children.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.26,0:07:20.58,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,And that isn't enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.01,0:07:23.33,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Your circumstances are special,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.33,0:07:27.64,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,so we have permission from His \NMajesty for schooling to be optional.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.77,0:07:30.59,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I smell nepotism...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.59,0:07:33.03,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,I don't appreciate that phrasing,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.03,0:07:35.35,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,and that's beside the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.30,0:07:37.72,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Give it some thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.73,0:07:43.85,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,About how to use my allowance, you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.85,0:07:46.11,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,No, not about your allowance!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.11,0:07:48.45,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,But you always complain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.45,0:07:52.26,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,It may seem like a waste of money to you, \Nbut I think I'm spending it responsibly!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.26,0:07:53.76,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Again, I'm not talking about your allowance!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.76,0:07:57.17,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Father, thank you for always working \Nhard to provide for the family!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.17,0:07:58.99,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Let's put that aside for now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.99,0:08:01.31,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Are you still mad at me, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.31,0:08:03.21,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for turning your \Ngarden into a sea of blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.21,0:08:04.58,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,That was unacceptable!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.58,0:08:06.98,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Next time, no allowance for six months!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.98,0:08:10.05,main,TINALISA,0,0,0,,Dear, we're not here to talk\Nabout that today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.18,0:08:15.72,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,I'm asking you to think\Nabout Princess Mirika.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.12,0:08:17.36,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Her Highness?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.36,0:08:22.19,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Those who do not fulfill their noble obligations\N are at a disadvantage in high society.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.63,0:08:27.69,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Because of you, Princess Mirika might be \Nviewed in a negative light in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.21,0:08:32.26,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Very well. I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.95,0:08:35.82,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Honestly, I think it's a hassle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.12,0:08:38.79,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,I'm not asking you to go for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.79,0:08:41.33,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,You just need to take the advancement exams.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.33,0:08:43.32,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,The advancement exams?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.32,0:08:47.52,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Pass them, and you'll receive the \Nofficial certificate of graduation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.52,0:08:51.34,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,There are five exams, so you only \Nneed to go to school five times.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.69,0:08:52.97,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,That's easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.97,0:08:58.10,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,Princess Mirika and I will graduate after the \Nnext exam, so you'll be taking it with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.77,0:09:02.71,main,TINALISA,0,0,0,,If that's the case, let's get you \Nready to go to school, Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.71,0:09:04.10,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes, Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.62,0:09:08.10,main,TINALISA,0,0,0,,You'll need clothes, shoes, and a nice coat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.43,0:09:10.48,main,TINALISA,0,0,0,,First, let's take your measurements.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.71,0:09:12.79,main,TINALISA,0,0,0,,Iko, I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.87,0:09:20.74,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,Ixio.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.46,0:09:24.41,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,There are other royals at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.41,0:09:28.50,main,ARSAN,0,0,0,,They may try to approach \NKunon and Princess Mirika.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.07,0:09:31.91,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,Have no fear. I will be with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.05,0:09:36.88,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,You're going to school?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.88,0:09:40.05,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes, though only for the advancement exams.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.05,0:09:42.65,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,That is wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.65,0:09:45.63,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,I get to spend time with you at school!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.63,0:09:50.15,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,To tell you the truth, I don't really \Nknow what to expect at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.42,0:09:51.73,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.73,0:09:54.40,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,I will escort you as your elder!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.40,0:09:56.35,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'll take you up on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.25,0:09:59.05,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,But I'm worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.11,0:10:06.66,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,If Your Highness is with me, then all the boys \Nwho are in love with you will be jealous of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.66,0:10:11.90,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,What? Oh, I'm certain it will be fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.42,0:10:14.76,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Are you not popular?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.76,0:10:15.96,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Of course I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.96,0:10:17.53,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,I am a princess, you know?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.53,0:10:22.81,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,There are boys who like me. As many as \Nthe number of fingers on my right hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.81,0:10:24.31,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,Right, so that's five.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.00,0:10:29.10,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,Perhaps I'll get a new cane for self-defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.12,0:10:46.10,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Wow, so dashing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.10,0:10:51.33,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Master Kunon, perhaps {\i1}you{\i0} were \Nthe model for the classic storybook prince?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.67,0:10:54.84,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Alas, my true identity has been revealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.84,0:10:56.93,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for not telling you the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.34,0:11:00.79,main - italics,IXIO/I,0,0,0,,Was my little brother always this shallow?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.90,0:11:00.79,main - top,IKO,0,0,0,,Prince, you're so handsome!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.39,0:11:06.49,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,A-ori.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.11,0:11:11.85,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I am off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.77,0:11:13.88,main,TINALISA,0,0,0,,Have a good day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.88,0:11:15.40,main,IKO,0,0,0,,Have a good day!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.13,0:11:23.85,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,Wow, it doesn't shake at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.85,0:11:27.96,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Father said a rough carriage \Nis bad for your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.96,0:11:30.03,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,Magic is convenient.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.03,0:11:35.48,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes. Since it's so versatile, even I may \Nbe able to find a job in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.48,0:11:37.50,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,Was that even a question?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.35,0:11:47.18,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,I'm sure you're nervous to \Ntravel far away from the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.49,0:11:48.98,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I wouldn't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.30,0:11:51.56,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I've grown a bit stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.30,0:11:54.56,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I know I've worried you a lot, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.41,0:12:01.00,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,When I fell and hurt myself...\NYou blamed yourself for that, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.00,0:12:02.07,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.58,0:12:04.34,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm all right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.69,0:12:10.59,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I used to wish I could just disappear, but \Nnow I'm determined to survive no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.05,0:12:13.37,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.49,0:12:18.50,main - italics,IXIO/I,0,0,0,,He truly has changed since learning magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.50,0:12:23.51,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I have a drive that I want to prevail,\Neven if the rest of the world perishes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.30,0:12:25.01,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,Hmm?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.46,0:12:28.04,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Big Brother. But I will live.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.04,0:12:32.39,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'll outlive everyone so thoroughly that \NI feel bad for the whole human race!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.39,0:12:34.93,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,Oh, okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.09,0:12:39.15,main - italics,IXIO/I,0,0,0,,I'm questioning if he really \Nis my little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.80,0:12:42.10,main - italics,IXIO/I,0,0,0,,Maybe it's the influence of that maid?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.10,0:12:43.39,main - italics,IKO/I,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.98,0:12:46.25,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Are we almost at school?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.25,0:12:48.36,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,Wow, you can tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.36,0:12:50.91,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes, I sense a lot of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.93,0:13:11.57,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Kunon! Master Ixio!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.98,0:13:17.96,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Good morning, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.96,0:13:21.64,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,May I have half of your day \Nso I can tell you how happy I am
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.64,0:13:24.57,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,to hear your beautiful voice \Nfirst thing in the morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.89,0:13:27.95,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Your bow tie is adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.36,0:13:29.57,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.27,0:13:33.91,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Oh, could it be that this is more \Nadorable than Your Highness?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.91,0:13:35.79,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,It could never.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.79,0:13:40.79,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Good. If you had said yes, I would have \Ntorn this off right here, right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.23,0:13:44.80,main - italics,IXIO/I,0,0,0,,What's up with these two?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.14,0:13:46.87,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Shall we go, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.74,0:13:54.06,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Kunon?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.06,0:13:59.46,main - italics,STUDENT A/I,0,0,0,,And then my cat...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.46,0:14:01.67,main - italics,STUDENT B/I,0,0,0,,Goodness, is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.82,0:14:02.96,main - italics top,TEACHER/I,0,0,0,,Today's exam will cover...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.96,0:14:04.43,main - italics,STUDENT C,0,0,0,,That's really cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.43,0:14:09.57,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,The presence of countless people\N and endless voices...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.07,0:14:14.04,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,My past self would have recoiled from this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.95,0:14:23.37,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,You Highness. May I become a girl just for now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.33,0:14:28.20,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Very well. Then I shall become a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.20,0:14:30.59,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Sweet young lady, may I have your hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.82,0:14:36.85,main,KAST,0,0,0,,It's almost time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.18,0:14:41.73,main,STUDENTS,0,0,0,,Good morning, Professor Kast.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.73,0:14:43.83,main,KAST,0,0,0,,Yes, good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.20,0:14:49.23,main - italics,KAST/I,0,0,0,,The second son of the marquess,\Nwith the Hero's Scar.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.59,0:14:52.20,main - italics,KAST/I,0,0,0,,I've heard rumors that he's a shy boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.11,0:14:57.19,main - italics,KAST/I,0,0,0,,Can a novice teacher like me handle \Nthe job of showing him around?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.19,0:14:59.71,main,STUDENT 1,0,0,0,,He's so charming! Like a prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.95,0:15:02.46,main,STUDENT 2,0,0,0,,But I don't remember\Na student like that here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.94,0:15:19.73,main,KAST,0,0,0,,Mr. Kunon Gurion!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.73,0:15:20.65,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.88,0:15:24.36,main,KAST,0,0,0,,I am Kast, a professor at this school.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.36,0:15:26.51,main,KAST,0,0,0,,I'll be your guide today.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.51,0:15:29.47,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Wonderful. Nice to meet you, Professor Kast.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.47,0:15:30.86,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I am Kunon Gurion.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.17,0:15:35.74,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm a girl right now, so allow me to curtsy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.12,0:15:37.49,main,KAST,0,0,0,,A girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.72,0:15:41.21,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Biologically a boy, with a personality of a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.21,0:15:44.94,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,But today, I'm a girl. A beautiful girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.89,0:15:47.18,main - italics,KAST/I,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.18,0:15:49.17,main - italics,KAST/I,0,0,0,,And why did he add "beautiful"?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.06,0:15:53.50,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,I'll see you later, Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.50,0:15:55.62,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,We'll have lunch together.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.62,0:15:58.72,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,Professor, I'll leave my brother in your care.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.72,0:16:00.02,main,KAST,0,0,0,,S-Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.02,0:16:02.18,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Good day, Princess Mirika.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.18,0:16:03.77,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'll see you later, Big Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.51,0:16:07.35,main - italics,KAST/I,0,0,0,,I've a feeling this will be a lot of work...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.33,0:16:12.78,main,BOOKER,0,0,0,,So that's the Hero's Scar, Kunon Gurion.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.11,0:16:17.86,main,MAEBY,0,0,0,,I hear he received blessings from His Majesty \Nas the first Hero's Scar born in 100 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.86,0:16:18.74,main,LYLE,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.03,0:16:21.89,main,BOOKER,0,0,0,,He doesn't seem like a big deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.89,0:16:24.54,main,EGG,0,0,0,,Right! Like a rolled-up roly-poly!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.54,0:16:28.34,main,MAEBY,0,0,0,,The Hero's Scar might just be \Nan unfounded superstition!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.31,0:16:34.34,main,LYLE,0,0,0,,Tch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.73,0:16:35.85,main,LYLE,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.23,0:16:39.09,main,HAINA,0,0,0,,Yes, Prince Lyle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.75,0:16:49.23,main,KAST,0,0,0,,Mr. Kunon Gurion. Did you hear the \Noverview of the advancement exams?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.48,0:16:54.24,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes. I was told that if I pass five exams, \NI can receive the certificate of graduation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.49,0:16:55.98,main,KAST,0,0,0,,That is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.98,0:17:02.64,main,KAST,0,0,0,,Normally, after taking an exam, there will \Nbe a period of time to prepare for the next.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.64,0:17:06.25,main,KAST,0,0,0,,As an exception, your exams \Nwill be held in a shorter period.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.55,0:17:08.00,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Exception?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.43,0:17:13.38,main,KAST,0,0,0,,I've received orders from your \Nfather and His Majesty to do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.07,0:17:18.34,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.83,0:17:22.90,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,My father and His Majesty are besties.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.90,0:17:24.42,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,This is nepotism.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.42,0:17:26.85,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I apologize for pressuring \Nthe school to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.78,0:17:32.12,main,KAST,0,0,0,,I'm going to pretend I didn't hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.12,0:17:35.82,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I hear these things happen \Nall the time in high society.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.22,0:17:41.13,main,KAST,0,0,0,,If anything is unclear, feel free to tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.13,0:17:42.58,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,They're thick as thieves.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.58,0:17:44.22,main,KAST,0,0,0,,Please begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.22,0:17:46.19,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,My father and His Majesty, I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.19,0:17:52.00,main,KAST,0,0,0,,I did say feel free to tell me, but please \Ndo not involve me in a political mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.00,0:17:54.12,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,This relationship has been going \Non since the previous generation—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.12,0:17:55.34,main,KAST,0,0,0,,Start the exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.15,0:18:09.10,main,KAST,0,0,0,,I never expected him to continue \Nchit-chatting for the whole exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.40,0:18:13.61,main,KAST,0,0,0,,And look what you get.\NThis question, that question.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.07,0:18:15.73,main,KAST,0,0,0,,All the other subjects...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.68,0:18:18.36,main,KAST,0,0,0,,He got everything right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.53,0:18:21.23,main,KAST,0,0,0,,It doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.36,0:18:29.96,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm famished.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.96,0:18:32.38,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,What would you like to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.74,0:18:38.83,main,LYLE,0,0,0,,Mirika.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.34,0:18:48.26,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Your Highness?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.11,0:18:51.90,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.57,0:19:04.55,main,LYLE,0,0,0,,Did this brat really receive \Nblessings from my father?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.23,0:19:06.49,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Brother Lyle!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.49,0:19:08.37,main,LYLE,0,0,0,,Stay out of this, Mirika.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.87,0:19:12.57,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,We were having a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.57,0:19:15.90,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,I don't care who it is, if they agonize \NHer Highness and get in our way...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.74,0:19:20.26,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,Did you want something with my \Nlittle brother, Prince Lyle?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.26,0:19:22.95,main,LYLE,0,0,0,,This is disrespectful, scion of the Gurions.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.95,0:19:25.45,main,LYLE,0,0,0,,I gave you no permission to speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.45,0:19:26.71,main,HAINA,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.71,0:19:28.02,main,HAINA,0,0,0,,What His Highness said.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.02,0:19:29.64,main,EGG,0,0,0,,Get lost, big brother of the roly-poly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.19,0:19:33.68,main - italics,IXIO/I,0,0,0,,Royalty approaching them on the first day?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.68,0:19:36.90,main - italics,IXIO/I,0,0,0,,And what the heck is the \Nbig brother of the roly-poly?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.90,0:19:38.31,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,A-ori.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.85,0:19:55.82,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,Status is supposed to be irrelevant at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.82,0:19:57.79,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,Let us smooth things over...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.79,0:20:00.92,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,What's this? Did he wet himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.40,0:20:02.13,main,LYLE,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.31,0:20:06.49,main,BOOKER,0,0,0,,Prince Lyle?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.49,0:20:07.43,main,LYLE,0,0,0,,I-I didn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.69,0:20:09.47,main,EGG,0,0,0,,But that looks like...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.47,0:20:11.06,main,MAEBY,0,0,0,,Like you have...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.06,0:20:12.44,main,LYLE,0,0,0,,I told you I didn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.32,0:20:20.35,main,LYLE,0,0,0,,Come!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.35,0:20:22.01,main,HAINA,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.12,0:20:25.85,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,A nuisance is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.93,0:20:28.45,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,What will you have, Big Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.45,0:20:29.90,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'd like a hamburger!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.90,0:20:31.64,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,Hold up, hold up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.64,0:20:34.25,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,Kunon, that was you, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.25,0:20:36.35,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Princess Mirika, what will you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.35,0:20:38.23,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'll have a hamburger!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.59,0:20:40.26,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Kunon...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.29,0:20:45.71,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,So, who was that earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.71,0:20:47.49,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,My brother, one year above me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.49,0:20:51.10,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Sixth Prince Lyle Hughlia.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.10,0:20:53.19,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Your Highness's big brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.19,0:20:54.45,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.45,0:20:59.44,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Because there can't be a big brother who \Ndoesn't cherish his little siblings!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.44,0:21:01.62,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,I wish that was true.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.11,0:21:04.09,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Is this true, Big Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.62,0:21:05.99,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.43,0:21:08.33,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I had no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.33,0:21:11.62,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm glad that you're my big brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.94,0:21:13.82,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,R-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.15,0:21:18.38,main - italics,IXIO/I,0,0,0,,My little brother really has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.47,0:21:22.92,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,We acted so out of line to\Nsomeone so untouchable.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.75,0:21:26.14,main,IXIO,0,0,0,,How should I report this to Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.14,0:21:28.80,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,This is very good, Big Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.29,0:21:32.03,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,This is how Kunon is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.34,0:21:35.16,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Rambling about it is not \Ngoing to change anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.47,0:21:37.27,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Let's enjoy our meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.50,0:21:39.43,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,The hamburger is tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.43,0:21:41.52,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Yes, it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.52,0:21:44.27,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,It is the best one I've ever tasted.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.27,0:21:46.16,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,That's wonderful to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.16,0:21:47.53,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,It is unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.82,0:21:47.53,main - italics top,IXIO/I,0,0,0,,Please let us graduate without \Nany further incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.35,0:23:40.25,main - top,SIGN {left top},0,0,0,,NEXT EPISODE: \NGRADUATION, AND WHAT'S NEXT?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.83,0:23:39.89,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Next episode:\N "Graduation, and What's Next?"
